BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:English Conversation Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T203000
UID:6a7a59d9f213992f00cb1baa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:CultureLink presents - English Conversation Circle\nAre you ne
 w to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee?\nPractice Eng
 lish in small groups and with the support of our Volunteer Mentors!\n9 w
 eekly sessions\nSpeak with confidence\nMake new friends\nNetwork and share
  experiences\nLearn about Canada and the Canadian culture\nCultureLink Se
 ttlement and Community Services is solely responsible for the protection 
 of personal information collected through the program\nregistration proce
 ss.\nEvery Monday starting September 14 - November 9\, 2026\n6:00 pm - 8:
 30 pm\nScarborough Civic Centre Library 156 Borough Dr\, Scarborough\, ON
  M1P 4N7
LOCATION:Scarborough Civic Centre\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7a59d9f213992f00cb1baa
X-SOURCE:Volunteer Toronto
END:VEVENT
