UID:6a47e8a0f47779f28bbe12bd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Free weekly sessions for Newcomers who want to prepare for the
  Citizenship test. Participants will learn about the test's content and st
 ructure\, get support and tips from our Volunteer Mentors\, and practice w
 ith sample quizzes.\nWalk-in participants please arrive by 5:45 pm.\nConta
 ct Rubeen to register or for more information at: rchauhan@culturelink.ca 
 or 437-249-7103\nCutureLink is solely responsible for the protection of pe
 rsonal information collected through the program registration process.
LOCATION:Burrows Hall
